gta(){return"How does a typical Coinetra investment work?"},
gtb(){return"Coinetra investment vehicles pool capital to invest in specific private equity funds or direct opportunities. Capital calls, distributions, and reporting are managed through our secure platform. We partner with industry-leading administrators and custodians."},
gtc(){return"What's the minimum commitment?"},
